      "value": "The original Cursor source unconditionally says not to change Git config. The owning AGENTS requires per-clone hook inspection and automatic normal installer setup when missing, retaining other hooks/configuration and installing only the declared PyYAML prerequisite. Existing hooks in this clone were already connected; no configuration was changed by this block."
